Prefix(:=<http://example.org/rules#>)
Ontology(<http://example.org/rules/same_consistent>
Declaration(Class(:A))
Declaration(Class(:B))
Declaration(Class(:Bad))
Declaration(Class(:Good))
Declaration(NamedIndividual(:a))
Declaration(NamedIndividual(:b))
DisjointClasses(:Bad :Good)
